@dsh-plugin/dsh-user-agent README · Install：The package is a [dsh bundle plugin](https://github.com/dsh-plugins) (`dsh.bundle.patch`), installable with the standard `dsh plugin add` command:

```bash
dsh plugin add @dsh-plugin/dsh-user-agent

@dsh-plugin/dsh-user-agent README · or, with a specific profile：dsh plugin --profile web add @dsh-plugin/dsh-user-agent
```

Then open **Settings → UA 设置** in the Web GUI: flip the switch on, type the `User-Agent` you want, and hit **保存 (Save)**.

@dsh-plugin/dsh-user-agent README · npm publish：`.github/workflows/npm-publish.yml` runs quality checks (matrix OS) and publishes:

- pushes to `main` → `X.Y.Z-dev.<run-id>` under the `next` dist-tag;
- tags `vX.Y.Z` (matching `package.json`) → publish `X.Y.Z` to `latest` with provenance.
